fields.inlineHelpText:
1) Gain Market Share: Meeting to increase your referrals with this customer to increase market share – customer potential remains unchanged;

2) Market Expansion: Meeting to increase customer potential by increasing the number of patients they refer – market share remains unchanged;

3) Maintain: Follow-up or maintenance meeting with the customer in order to retain market share;

4) Discover: Meeting to qualify the prospect to determine whether to target or not

